OL,3,GNEWSABeach site contract paused due to
OL,4,Alegal challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe contract for a beach site has been
OL,7,Fpaused due to the current occupier
OL,8,Fformally commencing a legal challenge
OL,9,Fagainst the council.
OL,11,FBournemouth, Christchurch and Poole
OL,12,F(BCP) Council confirmed that solicitors
OL,13,Facting for SOBO Beach have filed legal
OL,14,Fproceedings in relation to the contract
OL,15,Faward process relating to the
OL,16,FSouthbourne beach cafe.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
