OL,3,GNEWSABeach site contract paused due to
OL,4,Alegal challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast month councillors agreed that SOBO
OL,7,FBeach could remain at the Southbourne
OL,8,Fsite until September 2027. It came
OL,9,Fafter BCP Council awarded a 20-year
OL,10,Fcontract to a different operator to
OL,11,Ftake over the location.
OL,13,FA council spokesperson said the
OL,14,Fcontract award will be paused while the
OL,15,Fcourt process is ongoing and until the
OL,16,Fmatter has been determined.
